{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1416671-official-policy-with-the-use-of-avatars","id":1416671,"title":"Official policy with the use of Avatars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-03T20:14:43-07:00","id":1416671,"title":"Official policy with the use of Avatars","content":"Firstly it's great that there is an Avatar creator (Clan logos etc): <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> What would be important to know is how the official policy regarding the (private / none-commercial) use of these Avatars in the Internet are.<br /> May these be only used here? Or in the whole internet? May someone print them out etc.?<br /> Are minor alterations (like changing the background colors) allowed?<br /> <br /> And just out of interest: Do I understand it right that Paradox nowadays owns Vampire &amp; Werewolf and Onyx Path anything else of the WoD - expect these 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26345-xithar","name":"Xithar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26345_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T20:39:10-07:00","id":1416674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xithar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1416671-official-policy-with-the-use-of-avatars#post1416671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Firstly it's great that there is an Avatar creator (Clan logos etc):<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://theonyxpath.com/avatar/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> What would be important to know is how the official policy regarding the (private / none-commercial) use of these Avatars in the Internet are.<br /> May these be only used here? Or in the whole internet? May someone print them out etc.?<br /> <br /> Are minor alterations (like changing the background colors) allowed?</div> </div> </div> </div>Please see Paradox's <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com/dark-pack\" target=\"_blank\">Dark Pack agreement</a> for using their IP online.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And just out of interest: Do I understand it right that Paradox nowadays owns Vampire &amp; Werewolf and Onyx Path anything else of the WoD - expect these 2? </div> </div> </div>No. Paradox owns the World of Darkness, Chronicles of Darkness, and Exalted.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cud0YIil.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":4,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","user":"IanWatson","date":". 10-03-2020, 11:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}